    "detailed_description": "Hey... are you awake? Let's not keep the Clients waiting... oh, and welcome to the night shift.<br>You may already know your job, but let me remind you anyway:<br><br><strong>Find out what the Client wants</strong><br>It's a bit of a mess but I know you have what it takes to find the right items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/9884a25301939fc69d79c9543dd26667.poster.avif?t=1730505903\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/9884a25301939fc69d79c9543dd26667.webm?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/9884a25301939fc69d79c9543dd26667.mp4?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A happy Client makes for a smooth shift</strong><br>Choose the right items and it'll be Friday before you know it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/42e8b970244b465f97695f01e9fa50f8.poster.avif?t=1730505903\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/42e8b970244b465f97695f01e9fa50f8.webm?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/42e8b970244b465f97695f01e9fa50f8.mp4?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>That's coming out of your paycheck...</strong><br>Let's be extra careful and double check... we want to avoid unnecessary accidents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/f2342dc4a89bc6a1778befd402dc59b7.poster.avif?t=1730505903\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/f2342dc4a89bc6a1778befd402dc59b7.webm?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858320/extras/f2342dc4a89bc6a1778befd402dc59b7.mp4?t=1730505903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
